{"text":"kuruntokai","n":381,"lines":["தொல்கவின் தொலைந்து தோணலஞ் சாஅய்","அல்லல் நெஞ்சமோ டல்கலும் துஞ்சாது","பசலை யாகி விளிவது கொல்லோ","வெண்குருகு நரலுந் தண்கமழ் கானற்","பூமலி பொதும்பர் நாண்மலர் மயக்கி","விலங்குதிரை உடைதருந் துறைவனொ","டிலங்கெயிறு தோன்ற நக்கதன் பயனே"],"tr":["tolkaviṉ tolaintu tōṇalañ cāay","allal neñcamō ṭalkalum tuñcātu","pacalai yāki viḷivatu kollō","veṇkuruku naralun taṇkamaḻ kāṉaṟ","pūmali potumpar nāṇmalar mayakki","vilaṅkutirai uṭaitarun tuṟaivaṉo","ṭilaṅkeyiṟu tōṉṟa nakkataṉ payaṉē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"neytal","tinai_ta":"நெய்தல்","speaker_ta":"தோழி கூற்று","speaker_en":"her friend (tōḻi)"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"7 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"6×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 23, veṇcīr 4"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 15, veṇṭaḷai 8, kalittaḷai 3"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"தொல்கவின்","tr":"tolkaviṉ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தொல்","tr":"tol"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கவின்","tr":"kaviṉ"}]},{"text":"தொலைந்து","tr":"tolaintu","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தொலைந்","tr":"tolain"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"து","tr":"tu"}]},{"text":"தோணலஞ்","tr":"tōṇalañ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ணலஞ்","tr":"ṇalañ"}]},{"text":"சாஅய்","tr":"cāay","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சா","tr":"cā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"அய்","tr":"ay"}]}],[{"text":"அல்லல்","tr":"allal","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"அல்","tr":"al"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லல்","tr":"lal"}]},{"text":"நெஞ்சமோ","tr":"neñcamō","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நெஞ்","tr":"neñ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"சமோ","tr":"camō"}]},{"text":"டல்கலும்","tr":"ṭalkalum","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"டல்","tr":"ṭal"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கலும்","tr":"kalum"}]},{"text":"துஞ்ச